hadiths[28]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1869","Agharr Muzani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak merey dil par ghubaar sa chha jata hai, aur beshak main Allah se din mein sau martaba maghfirat maangta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1870","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah ki qasam! Beshak main Allah se maghfirat maangta hun aur din mein sattar martaba se zyada uski taraf tauba karta hun. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1871","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Agar tum gunah na kartey to Allah Taala tumhey le jata aur aisi qaum lata jo gunah kartey phir Allah Taala se maghfirat maangtey to wo unhey bakhsh deta. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1872","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye aik hi majlis mein sau martaba shumaar kartey they: Ae merey Rab! Mujhey bakhsh dey aur meri tauba qabool farma, beshak Tu hi tauba qabool karne wala rehem wala hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih ghareeb hadis hai."
"1873","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs istighfaar ko laazim pakrey, Allah uske liye har tangi se nikaalney ka rasta banayega aur har ghum se kushadgi ata farmayega, aur usey wahan se rizq dega jahan se wo gumaan nahi karta. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"1874","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kahey: Main Allah se maghfirat maangta hun jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi, jo zinda qayam rehne wala hai, aur main uski taraf tauba karta hun, to uske gunah bakhsh diye jatey hain chaahey wo maidaane jang se bhaaga ho. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi aur Haakim ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Bukhari aur Muslim ki shart par sahih hadis hai."
"1875","Shaddaad bin Aus (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sayyidul Istighfaar ye hai ke banda kahey: Ae Allah! Tu mera Rab hai, Tere siwa koi mabood nahi, Tune mujhey paida kya aur main Tera banda hun, aur main apne ahd aur waadey par qaim hun jahan tak ho saka, main us shar se Teri panah maangta hun jo main ne kya, main Tere saamney Teri apni naimat ka iqraar karta hun, aur apne gunah ka iqraar karta hun, isliye mujhey bakhsh dey kyonke Tere siwa gunah koi nahi bakhshta. Jo shakhs din mein isey yaqeen ke sath kahey phir usi din shaam se pehley mar jaey to wo Jannat walon mein se hai, aur jo shakhs raat mein isey yaqeen ke sath kahey phir subah se pehley mar jaey to wo Jannat walon mein se hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1876","Saubaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apni namaz se farigh hotey to teen martaba Allah se maghfirat maangtey aur farmatey: Ae Allah! Tu salaam hai aur Tujh hi se salaamti hai, Tu barkat wala hai ae jalal aur izzat waley. Auzai se, jo iske aik rawi hain, poochha gaya ke istighfaar kaisey hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Kehta hai: Main Allah se maghfirat maangta hun, main Allah se maghfirat maangta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1877","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni wafaat se pehley kasrat se kehtey they: Allah paak hai apni hamd ke sath, main Allah se maghfirat maangta hun aur uski taraf tauba karta hun. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1878","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah Taala ne farmaya: Ae aadmi ke betey! Beshak tu jab tak mujh se dua maangta raheyga aur mujh se ummeed rakheyga main tujhey bakhshta rahunga jo kuchh tujh se hua aur mujhey koi parwah nahi, ae aadmi ke betey! Agar terey gunah aasmaan ke kinaaron tak pahunch jaein phir tu mujh se maghfirat maangey to main tujhey bakhsh dunga aur mujhey koi parwah nahi, ae aadmi ke betey! Beshak agar tu merey paas zameen bhar khataein lekar aey phir mujh se is haal mein miley ke tu merey sath kisi chiz ko shareek nahi thehrata tha to main terey paas us bhar maghfirat lekar aaunga."
"1879","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae aurton ki jamaat! Sadqa karo aur kasrat se maghfirat maango, kyonke main ne tumhey dozakh walon mein aksariyat mein dekha hai. Un mein se aik aurat ne kaha: Hamein kya hai ke ham dozakh walon mein aksariyat hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum kasrat se laanat karti ho aur shohar ki na-shukri karti ho, main ne aqal aur deen mein naqis honay ke bawajood aqal waley par ghalib aaney mein tum se badh kar kisi ko nahi dekha. Us ne kaha: Aqal aur deen ka nuqsaan kya hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do aurton ki gawahi aik mard ki gawahi ke barabar hai, aur wo kayi din thehri rehti hai namaz nahi padhti. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1880","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat waley is mein khaengey aur piyengey, aur na pakhana kareingey aur na naak saaf kareingey aur na peshab kareingey, lekin unka wo khana daakaar hoga jo mushk ke paseeney ki tarah hoga, unhey tasbeeh aur takbeer aise ilhaam ki jaeygi jaisey saans ilhaam ki jati hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1881","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala ne farmaya: Main ne apne naik bandon ke liye wo taiyaar kya hai jo na kisi aankh ne dekha aur na kisi kaan ne suna aur na kisi bashar ke dil mein uska khayaal aaya, aur agar chaho to padho: Phir koi jaan nahi jaanti jo unke liye aankhon ki thandak chhupa kar rakhi gai hai badla iska jo wo amal kartey they (As-Sajdah: 17). (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1882","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat mein dakhil honay wali pehli jamaat chaand ki soorat par hogi chaundhween raat ke chaand ki tarah, phir unke baad waley aasmaan mein sab se zyada roshan chamakdaar sitaarey ki tarah, na peshab kareingey aur na pakhana kareingey, aur na thookengy aur na naak saaf kareingey, unki kanghiyan soney ki hongi, aur unka paseena mushk hoga, aur unki angeethiyan ood ki hongi, unki biwiyan hoor-e-ain hongi, aik aadmi ki khilqat par, apne walid Aadam ki soorat par saath haath lambey aasmaan mein. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Bukhari aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Us mein unke bartan soney ke hongey, aur unka paseena mushk hoga, aur un mein se har aik ke liye do biwiyan hongi jin ki pindliyon ka ghooda husn ki wjah se gosht ke peechey se nazar aayega, unke darmiyaan na ikhtilaaf hoga aur na bughz, unke dil aik aadmi ke dil ki tarah hongey, wo subah aur shaam Allah ki tasbeeh kareingey. Uska qaul (aik aadmi ki khilqat par), baaz ne ise kha ke fatha aur laam ke sukoon ke sath riwayat kya hai aur baaz ne donon ke zamma ke sath, aur donon sahih hain."
"1883","Mugheera bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musa (Alehis salaam) ne apne Rab se sawal kya: Jannat walon mein sab se kam darjey wala kaun hai? Allah ne farmaya: Wo aik aadmi hai jo iske baad aayega ke Jannat waley Jannat mein dakhil kar diye gaey, to us se kaha jaeyga: Jannat mein dakhil ho, to wo kaheyga: Ae merey Rab! Kaisey jabke logon ne apne manaazil mein qayaam kar liya aur apney hissey le liye? To us se kaha jaeyga: Kya tu raazi hai ke terey liye duniya ke baadshahon mein se aik baadshah ki baadshahat ke barabar ho? To wo kaheyga: Main raazi hun ae Rab. To Allah farmayega: Terey liye ye hai aur us jaisa aur us jaisa aur us jaisa aur us jaisa, to wo panchween martaba kaheyga: Main raazi hun ae Rab. To Allah farmayega: Ye terey liye hai aur iske das guna, aur terey liye wo hai jis ki tera nafs khuwahish karey aur teri aankh lazzat paey, to wo kaheyga: Main raazi hun ae Rab. Musa ne kaha: Ae Rab! To sab se buland darjey waley kaun hain? Allah ne farmaya: Wo jinhey main ne chaha, main ne unki izzat apne haath se lagai aur us par mohar lagai, to na kisi aankh ne dekha aur na kisi kaan ne suna aur na kisi bashar ke dil mein uska khayaal aaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1884","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main dozakh se nikalney walon mein sab se aakhir mein nikalney waley ko aur Jannat walon mein sab se aakhir mein Jannat mein dakhil honay waley ko jaanta hun, wo aik aadmi hai jo dozakh se ghisat kar niklega, to Allah Azza wa Jall us se farmayega: Jao Jannat mein dakhil ho, to wo uske paas aayega, to usey khayaal hoga ke wo bhari hui hai, to wo wapas aayega aur kaheyga: Ae Rab! Main ne usey bhara hua paaya, to Allah Azza wa Jall us se farmayega: Jao Jannat mein dakhil ho. Phir wo aayega, to usey khayaal hoga ke wo bhari hui hai, to wo wapas aayega aur kaheyga: Ae Rab! Main ne usey bhara hua paaya! To Allah Azza wa Jall us se farmayega: Jao Jannat mein dakhil ho, kyonke terey liye duniya ke barabar aur uske das guna hai, ya farmaya: Beshak terey liye duniya ke das guna ke barabar hai, to wo kaheyga: Kya Tu mujh se mazaak karta hai, ya mujh par hansta hai jabke Tu Baadshah hai? Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap hansey yahan tak ke Aap ki daadhein zaahir ho gaein, aur Aap farmatey they: Ye Jannat walon mein sab se kam darjey wala hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1885","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak momin ke liye Jannat mein aik khaima hai aik khokhli moti ka jis ki lambai aasmaan mein saath meel hai, momin ke liye us mein ghar waley hain, momin unke paas phirta hai to un mein se koi doosrey ko nahi dekhta. (Muttafaqun aleh). Meel chhey hazaar haath hota hai."
"1886","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein aik darakht hai jisey tez raftaar tayyaar ghodey par sawaar sau saal chaley tab bhi usey tey na kar sakey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur un donon ne Sahihain mein Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) ki riwayat se bhi riwayat kya hai, unhon-ne kaha: Sawaar uske saaey mein aik saal chaley tab bhi usey tey na kar sakey."
"1887","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat waley apne oopar baala khaanon walon ko aise dekheingey jaisey tum ufq mein doobtey huey chamakdaar sitaarey ko dekhtey ho mashriq ya maghrib mein, unke darmiyaan fazilat ki wjah se. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye to ambiya ke manaazil hain jinhey unke siwa koi nahi paa sakta? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kyun nahi, us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Wo aadmi jo Allah par imaan laey aur Rasoolon ki tasdeeq ki. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1888","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat mein kamaan ke barabar jagah us se behtar hai jis par suraj tuloo ya ghuroob hota hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1889","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein aik bazaar hai jis mein wo har Juma ko aaengey, phir shumaal ki hawa chalegi, to wo unke chehron aur kapdon par khushbu daalegi, to wo husn aur jamaal mein badh jaengey, phir wo apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas aaengey jabke wo husn aur jamaal mein badhey huey hongey, to unke ghar waley un se kaheingey: Allah ki qasam! Tum hamarey baad husn aur jamaal mein badh gaey ho! To wo kaheingey: Aur tum bhi Allah ki qasam hamarey baad husn aur jamaal mein badh gaey ho! Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1890","Sehel bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat waley Jannat mein baala khaanon ko aise dekheingey jaisey tum aasmaan mein sitaarey ko dekhtey ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1891","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aik majlis mein haazir tha jis mein Aap ne Jannat ka wasf farmaya yahan tak ke khatm kya, phir apni hadis ke aakhir mein farmaya: Us mein wo hai jo na kisi aankh ne dekha aur na kisi kaan ne suna aur na kisi bashar ke dil mein uska khayaal aaya. Phir Aap ne ye aayat padhi: Unke pehlu bistaron se judaa rehtey hain, yahan tak ke Allah Taala ke qaul tak: Phir koi jaan nahi jaanti jo unke liye aankhon ki thandak chhupa kar rakhi gai hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1892","Abu Saeed aur Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Jannat waley Jannat mein dakhil hongey to munadi karne wala nida karega: Beshak tumharey liye hai ke tum zinda raho to kabhi na maro, aur beshak tumharey liye hai ke tum sehatmand raho to kabhi beemar na ho, aur beshak tumharey liye hai ke tum jawaan raho to kabhi boodhey na ho, aur beshak tumharey liye hai ke tum naimat mein raho to kabhi bad-haal na ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1893","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein se har aik ka Jannat mein sab se kam thikana ye hai ke us se kaha jaeyga: Tamanna kar, to wo tamanna karega aur tamanna karega, to us se kaha jaeyga: Kya tum tamanna kar chukey? To wo kaheyga: Haan, to us se kaha jaeyga: To terey liye wo hai jis ki tune tamanna ki aur uske sath us jaisa. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1894","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Azza wa Jall Jannat walon se farmayega: Ae Jannat walon! To wo kaheingey: Haazir hain ae hamarey Rab aur saadatmand, aur bhalai Terey donon haathon mein hai. To Allah farmayega: Kya tum raazi ho? To wo kaheingey: Aur hamein kya hai ke ham raazi na hon ae hamarey Rab jabke Tune hamein wo diya jo Tune apni makhlooq mein se kisi ko nahi diya! To Allah farmayega: Kya main tumhey is se afzal na dun? To wo kaheingey: Aur is se afzal kya chiz hai? To Allah farmayega: Main tum par apni raza naazil karta hun, to iske baad tum par kabhi naraaz nahi hunga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1895","Jareer bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas they to Aap ne chaundhween raat ke chaand ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Beshak tum anqareeb apne Rab ko aise aamney saamney dekhogey jaisey tum is chaand ko dekhtey ho, uske dekhney mein tum par zulm nahi kya jaeyga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1896","Suhaib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Jannat waley Jannat mein dakhil hongey to Allah Tabarak wa Taala farmayega: Kya tum chaahtey ho ke main tumhey kuchh zyada dun? To wo kaheingey: Kya Tune hamarey chehrey safed nahi kiye? Kya Tune hamein Jannat mein dakhil nahi kya aur dozakh se nijaat nahi di? To parda utha diya jaeyga, to unhey apne Rab ki taraf dekhney se zyada mehboob koi chiz nahi di gai hogi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Allah Taala ne farmaya: Beshak jo log imaan laey aur naik amal kiye unka Rab unhey unke imaan ke sabab hidayat dega, unke neechey Jannatun Naeem mein nehrein behti hongi. Us mein unki dua hogi: Ae Allah! Tu paak hai, aur us mein unka tohfa salaam hoga, aur unki aakhri dua hogi ke tamam tareefein Allah ke liye hain jo jahaanon ka Rab hai (Yunus: 9, 10). Tamam tareefein Allah ke liye hain jis ne hamein iski hidayat di aur ham hidayat paaney waley na they agar Allah hamein hidayat na deta. Ae Allah! Muhammad par aur Aale Muhammad par rehmat bhej jaisa Tune Ibrahim par aur Aale Ibrahim par rehmat bheji, aur Muhammad par aur Aale Muhammad par barkat bhej jaisa Tune Ibrahim par aur Aale Ibrahim par barkat bheji, beshak Tu hamd wala buzrugi wala hai. Musannif ne (Raziallahu anhu) farmaya: Main is se peer ke din Ramazan ki chaar tareekh san saat sau sattar hijri mein farigh hua."
